%% section: Phases and container states
%% caption: Pod lifecycle and the three probes
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant API as API server
    participant K as kubelet
    participant C as Container
    participant EP as Endpoints
    API->>K: pod assigned
    K->>C: pull image, create sandbox, start init containers
    C->>C: main container starts
    K->>C: startup probe — gives a slow starter room
    Note over K,C: while the startup probe runs, liveness and readiness are suppressed
    K->>C: readiness probe
    C-->>K: ready
    K->>EP: add to the Service endpoints — traffic arrives now
    loop while running
        K->>C: liveness probe
        alt liveness fails
            K->>C: restart the container
        end
        K->>C: readiness probe
        alt readiness fails
            K->>EP: remove from endpoints, do not restart
        end
    end
